OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 30 AUG
OL,4,CPROGRAMMES
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1957FThe first regional news
OL,7,Fbroadcast from Scotland airs on BBC TV.
OL,8,FIt was a five-minute bulletin presented
OL,9,Fby Alastair Macintyre. It aired a day
OL,10,Fbefore the launch of Scottish TV and
OL,11,Fwas not in advance published listings.
OL,12,
OL,13,CG1976FThe first edition of News at
OL,14,F5.45 airs on ITV.
OL,15,
OL,16,CG1980FThe first episode of Juliet
OL,17,FBravo airs on BBC One.
OL,18,
OL,19,CG1985FThe first edition of Cool It
OL,20,Fairs on BBC Two.
OL,21,
