OL,5,
OL,6,CG1985FThe first episode of Albion
OL,7,FMarket airs on ITV.
OL,8,
OL,9,CG1985FThe first episode of Drummonds
OL,10,Fairs on ITV.
OL,11,
OL,12,CG1985FThe weekday lunchtime Financial
OL,13,FReport, broadcast on BBC One in London
OL,14,Fand the south east, is broadcast for
OL,15,Fthe final time. It would be replaced
OL,16,Fthe following Monday by a new lunchtime
OL,17,Fregional news bulletin for viewers in
OL,18,Fthe BBC South East region.
OL,19,
OL,20,CG1988FThe first edition of Floyd on
OL,21,FBritain and Ireland airs on BBC Two.
